1. MediaTek Neuron Adapter / MDLA runtime
-----------------------------------------
KAtorch talks to the NPU through `libneuron_adapter_mgvi.so`, which is proprietary
firmware-adjacent software shipped inside the device's `/vendor/lib64` partition by
the hardware vendor. KAtorch loads it at runtime with `dlopen()` only.

Neither the library itself nor any vendor header is distributed here. The headers in
the vendor SDK (`NeuronAdapter.h` and friends) carry an explicit MediaTek
confidential/proprietary notice and are deliberately excluded from this repository.
Users must obtain any such material from their own device or from MediaTek under
their own terms.

No MediaTek code is compiled into, linked against, or redistributed by this project.


2. ComfyUI
----------
